---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { pricesProvider } from '../lib/views';
---
<Layout
  title="Affiliate disclosure | HotelsViewer"
  description="How HotelsViewer may earn commissions from booking links, and what that means for the rooms we list."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
      <p class="small updated">Last updated: October 18, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose measure">
      <p class="callout"><strong>In short:</strong> some links on HotelsViewer may be affiliate links. If you book through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. It never changes which rooms we list.</p>

      <h2>How the links work</h2>
      <p>The “Check prices” buttons first go to an address on our own site (hotelsviewer.com/go/…) and from there to a booking site. Right now they open a search on {pricesProvider}. When we take part in a booking site's or travel network's affiliate program, these links may be credited to us, and the booking site may pay us a commission when you complete a stay. The price you pay is the same as it would be without our link. We use a script from our partner Stay22 that can turn hotel links on this site into affiliate links.</p>
      <p>Some pages also have an “After the window” section with tickets and transport. Those buttons go to a seller such as Tiqets or Klook through Travelpayouts, a travel affiliate network, and work the same way: we may earn a commission, and the price is the same for you. We list only products we have seen on the seller's own page, and we name them as the seller does.</p>

      <h2>What this means for the rooms we list</h2>
      <p>We list a room because it is sold with the view, not because someone pays us. A hotel that earns us nothing is listed in the same way, and we never hide a better room because of a commission.</p>

      <h2>Prices, room names and availability</h2>
      <p>We don't show prices. Rates, room names and availability change often, and a room category we list can be renamed or sold out. Always check the room category and the final price on the booking page before you pay. The booking site or the hotel is responsible for your booking, the stay and any refund.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If anything here is unclear, please <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .callout {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--brass);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
  }
</style>
